fedora-kernel
# Line 1 is the tag of the kernel reserve: Lucciola with Fedora's kernel
# instead of the CachyOS one, ghcr.io/daniel-g-carrasco/lucciola:<tag>.
# The one place the name lives in code. Read by
#   /usr/libexec/margine/kernel-switch (ujust lucciola-kernel), on devices
#   .github/workflows/build-fedora-kernel.yml, which publishes <tag>,
#     <tag>.YYYYMMDD and the <tag>-test of a manual run
#   .github/workflows/stale-image-alarm.yml
# To rename: change line 1, then the "fedora-kernel*" pattern in
# ghcr-cleanup.yml's exclude-tags and the docs (README, CHANGELOG, the
# guide in site/index.html). Installs that follow the old tag keep
# following it after it stops moving: move them before retiring it.
